      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 4,
        "text": "Thank you, Professor Fleming. It's always an honor to be asked back and I do it gladly because I feel if even one thing I say or demonstrate today helps you in any way as you embark on your careers, everyone will have benefited-you, those that are grieving, and the deceased."
